OL,3,GNEWSACar park closure order over
OL,4,Aantisocial behaviour
OL,5,
OL,6,FA closure order for a multi-storey car
OL,7,Fpark has been granted because of what
OL,8,Fpolice said were reports of 'serious
OL,9,Fand ongoing antisocial behaviour'.
OL,11,FThe Belgrade Plaza site in Coventry
OL,12,Fcity centre has been shut since April,
OL,13,Fafter operator National Car parks (NCP)
OL,14,Fwent into administration, but people
OL,15,Fhave continued to park their cars
OL,16,Fthere.
OL,18,FThe area has seen a rise in antisocial
OL,19,Fbehaviour and drug taking, West
OL,20,FMidlands Police said.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
