OL,3,GNEWSACar park closure order over
OL,4,Aantisocial behaviour
OL,5,
OL,6,F"By obtaining a closure order we are
OL,7,Faiming to reduce drug use, trespassing
OL,8,Fand threatening behaviour in the car
OL,9,Fpark. Antisocial behaviour has no place
OL,10,Fin our city centre," Insp Maria Perrin
OL,11,Fsaid.
